imProcessCreate
| where TargetProcessCommandLine contains "WindowsAudioDevice-Powershell-Cmdlet" or TargetProcessCommandLine contains "Toggle-AudioDevice" or TargetProcessCommandLine contains "Get-AudioDevice " or TargetProcessCommandLine contains "Set-AudioDevice " or TargetProcessCommandLine contains "Write-AudioDevice "